{"id":"ho_chstens","lemma":"höchstens","pos":"adv","rank":2241,"glosses":["at most"],"ipa":"/ˈhøːçstəns/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0e/De-h%C3%B6chstens.ogg/De-h%C3%B6chstens.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er hat höchstens 100 Dollar.","en":"He has at most 100 dollars.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/41326","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"dollar"}]},{"text":"Ich kann höchstens vier Tage warten.","en":"I can wait four days at the longest.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,{"g":"four (numerical value…"},{"g":"period"},{"g":"to wait"}]},{"text":"Es dauert höchstens drei Stunden.","en":"At most, it'll only take three hours.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to last","l":"dauern"},null,{"g":"three (numerical value…"},{"g":"to defer (due date"}]},{"text":"Sie ist höchstens achtzehn.","en":"She is eighteen at most.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"eighteen"}]},{"text":"Sie ist höchstens zwanzig Jahre alt.","en":"She's at most 20 years old.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"twenty"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"old"}]}]}